{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1478977-why-are-the-spirit-talkers-from-da-m-so-weak","id":1478977,"title":"Why are the Spirit-Talkers from DA:M so weak?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-16T15:10:40-07:00","id":1478977,"title":"Why are the Spirit-Talkers from DA:M so weak?","content":"The Spirit-Talkers seem like the perfect fellowship for someone who wants to play shaman, necromancer, or even a druid. But even with all this, they feel extremely underpowered compared to the other fellowships. The order of Hermes are practical demigods, the Messianic Voices have the power of heaven on their side, the Valdaermen are masters of fate and travel, the old faith are masters of the land, and the Ahl-i-Batin are master spies. The Spirit-Talkers on the other hand have to constantly ask the spirits around them for help, and are practically dependent on the spirits.<br /> <br /> So my questions for you is...<br /> <br /> What are somethings that the Spirit-Talkers can do, that would make the other fellowships jealous?<br /> <br /> What tier are the Spirit-Talkers in terms of power?<br /> <br /> Is their pillar magick even worth taking?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://www.nodiatis.com/pub/18.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27313-hello","name":"Hello","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27313_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-16T15:36:42-07:00","id":1478978,"title":"","content":"You're conflating \u201cwhat they can do\u201d with \u201chow they do it\u201d. It's similar to a complaint that was made recently that the Valdaermen \u201caren't worth it\u201d because they're so reliant on sacrifices. <br /> <br /> I don't have my book handy at the moment, so I'm not ins position to give an answer on \u201cwhat can they do\u201d; but before you write off the Spirit Talkers because they have to talk to spirits, I'd recommend taking another look at what the other Fellowships have to do in order to use their magic. The Messianic Voices, for instance, have to maintain a fairly strict code of conduct in order to avoid being cut off from the source of their power. I think you'll find that every Fellowship has <i>some</i> price that it must pay for its magic; and whether or not you find a given Fellowship \u201cworth it\u201d depends heavily on whether or not you find their \u201cprice of power\u201d acceptable.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-17T18:54:12-07:00","id":1479048,"title":"","content":"Pillar magic by design was meant to be more limited than sphere magick because it was shaped by the specific paradigm of the Fellowship and the limits of their knowledge and beliefs. That means some things are going to be harder for certain fellowships whereas other things will be easier. Heck even Sorcerer's Crusade featured a certain degree of this I believe even though it uses the same sphere magic system that modern mage does. Knowledge and imagination can count for *a lot* with Dynamic magic but the way pillars are set up you're still going to face limits. <br /> <br /> The Dark Age Mage's Grimoire had a section that even covered how different fellowships accomplished different things and that really illustrated why creativity mattered. The Batini for example have a hard time doing 'direct damage' attacks (note the Spirit-Talkers aren't included here) so they have to either augment existing abilities with their spacetime mastery and/or bring the attack to the person or the person to the attack (making a single attack behave as multiple simultaneous strikes, or they use their mastery to either teleport a person into some sort of hazardous environment or bring that hazardous environment to their location - like the Tears of Allah also described in the Grimoire which creates a directed conduit for elemental forces like a volcanic eruption). Conversely, under the Pillar system the Hermetics and Voices have few means of tapping into Necromantic powers and the Batini have none at all.<br /> <br /> It's like Devil Fruit in one piece. The power can *seem* useless, but if you're sufficiently clever and creative you can accomplish a great deal with it. <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25533-mister_dunpeal","name":"Mister_Dunpeal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25533_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"308"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}